Pure JavaScript plugin — no third-party native dependencies. Uses only
the standard webview APIs `navigator.gpu` (WebGPU), `WebGLRenderingContext`
and `WebGL2RenderingContext` (WebGL 1/2), `navigator.deviceMemory`, and
`performance.memory` (when exposed by the host browser/webview).
